# v1.8.1:
- Add an East Asia option to the Nation Removal setting
- Fix the wrong RGO briefly showing on locations in the Raw Materials map mode
- Remove the Deal With the Robber Barons fix, which was working around a vanilla issue this mod does not cause

# v1.8.0:
- Update for game v1.3.11
- Optimized map markers for better FPS
- Fix a crash when using the Asia Centric removal
- Fix building, rank upgrade, recruitment, and ship build times not exactly matching vanilla
- Fix your own construction, recruitment, and child education bonuses being worth less than they should
- Fix the Army Movement Speed, Navy Movement Speed, and Battle Length settings distorting your own bonuses to those
- Remove the Save Game Compatibility setting, which no longer did anything

# v1.7.3:
- Update for game v1.3.10
- Now Ironman and Achievement compatible
- Fix armies losing too little morale while moving
- Fix megalopolis upgrades taking twice as long as they should

# v1.7.2:
- Update for game v1.3.6
- Makes use of a new performance define added in v1.3.6

# v1.7.1:
- Update for game v1.3.4
- Character Culling now only removes adults
- Fix naval battles lasting far too long

# v1.7.0:
- Update for game v1.3
- Makes use of 5 new performance defines added in v1.3

# v1.6.5:
- Fix Deal With the Robber Barons not ending when multiple are active at once.

# v1.6.4:
- Update define for v1.2.2 previously missed.

# v1.6.3:
- Update for v1.2.2
- Remove all trade related define changes

# v1.6.2:
- Fix army modifiers for v1.2
- Fix Deal With the Robber Barons not ending
- Temporarily Revert 1.2 defines changes until more testing is done

# v1.6.1:
- Update for v1.2
- Makes use of new performance defines added in 1.2

# v1.6.0:
- [b]New Character Culling optimization[/b] with a configurable max characters per nation

# v1.5.6:
- Fix keybinds for game speeds so they map to the correct speeds
- Fix starting the game below speed 1
- Fix being able to decrease the game speed below speed 1
- Fix "Game Speed when War Starts" setting (not when selected unit enters combat which still has issues)

# v1.5.5:
- Add missing dependency notice

# v1.5.4:
- Remove more from disabled locations when recolonization is disabled

# v1.5.3:
- Fix for the fix for the fix for navy speed

# v1.5.2:
- Fix the fix for navy speed

# v1.5.1:
- Fix incorrect navy speed when loading on existing saves

# v1.5.0:
- [b]New mod menu[/b] integrated with the Community Mod Framework
- [b]New customization options[/b] with toggles for controlling army/navy speed, and the ability to run removals mid-game
- [b]Improved save game compatibility[/b] with better save game detection and a manual toggle for when automatic detection fails

Note you will now need to subscribe to the [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3692202776]Community Mod Framework[/url] and enable both mods.
